  {
    "id": "doc-mcp",
    "tenant_id": "tenant-a",
    "title": "MCP 核心边界",
    "content": "MCP 连接 Agent Host 与外部工具和数据源。Tools 由模型选择调用，Resources 由应用选择读取，Prompts 是用户显式选择的服务器模板。",
    "source_uri": "kb://tenant-a/mcp",
    "version": 3,
    "updated_at": "2026-07-01T00:00:00Z",
    "expires_at": null,
    "deleted": false,
    "authority": 1.0,
    "allowed_users": ["user-1", "user-2"]
  },
  {
    "id": "doc-jsonrpc",
    "tenant_id": "tenant-a",
    "title": "JSON-RPC 约定",
    "content": "JSON-RPC 请求包含 jsonrpc、id、method 和 params。通知没有 id，因此接收方不返回响应。错误响应通过 error.code、error.message 和可选 error.data 表达。",
    "source_uri": "kb://tenant-a/jsonrpc",
    "version": 2,
    "updated_at": "2026-06-20T00:00:00Z",
    "expires_at": null,
    "deleted": false,
    "authority": 1.0,
    "allowed_users": ["user-1", "user-2"]
  },
  {
    "id": "doc-oauth",
    "tenant_id": "tenant-a",
    "title": "OAuth 与 OIDC",
    "content": "OAuth 2.0 解决委托授权，Access Token 给资源服务器验证 API 访问。OIDC 在 OAuth 2.0 上增加身份层，ID Token 给客户端验证登录身份。",
    "source_uri": "kb://tenant-a/oauth",
    "version": 4,
    "updated_at": "2026-07-10T00:00:00Z",
    "expires_at": null,
    "deleted": false,
    "authority": 1.0,
    "allowed_users": ["user-1"]
  },
  {
    "id": "doc-rag",
    "tenant_id": "tenant-a",
    "title": "RAG 安全检索",
    "content": "RAG 的最终上下文必须同时满足相关性和当前访问权限。推荐先在召回阶段使用 tenant 与 ACL 过滤，再在进入模型上下文前执行最终授权校验。",
    "source_uri": "kb://tenant-a/rag",
    "version": 5,
    "updated_at": "2026-07-15T00:00:00Z",
    "expires_at": null,
    "deleted": false,
    "authority": 1.0,
    "allowed_users": ["user-1", "user-2"]
  },
  {
    "id": "doc-metrics",
    "tenant_id": "tenant-a",
    "title": "RAG 评估指标",
    "content": "Recall@K 衡量前 K 个结果覆盖相关证据的能力。MRR 关注第一个相关结果的倒数排名。引用正确率判断引用是否支持相邻主张，答案忠实度判断回答主张是否能被上下文蕴含。",
    "source_uri": "kb://tenant-a/metrics",
    "version": 2,
    "updated_at": "2026-07-16T00:00:00Z",
    "expires_at": null,
    "deleted": false,
    "authority": 1.0,
    "allowed_users": ["user-1", "user-2"]
  },
  {
    "id": "doc-context",
    "tenant_id": "tenant-a",
    "title": "Context Engineering",
    "content": "Context Engineering 的目标是在有限 Token 预算中选择最小而高信号的上下文。长任务可使用摘要压缩、结构化笔记和子 Agent 隔离，并保留来源、版本和未决事项。",
    "source_uri": "kb://tenant-a/context",
    "version": 1,
    "updated_at": "2026-07-18T00:00:00Z",
    "expires_at": null,
    "deleted": false,
    "authority": 0.95,
    "allowed_users": ["user-1", "user-2"]
  },
  {
    "id": "doc-memory",
    "tenant_id": "tenant-a",
    "title": "Agent Memory 分类",
    "content": "Semantic Memory 保存事实，Episodic Memory 保存过去事件，Procedural Memory 保存规则与流程。Checkpoint 保存线程恢复状态，不应代替业务数据库。",
    "source_uri": "kb://tenant-a/memory",
    "version": 2,
    "updated_at": "2026-07-19T00:00:00Z",
    "expires_at": null,
    "deleted": false,
    "authority": 1.0,
    "allowed_users": ["user-1", "user-2"]
  },
  {
    "id": "doc-streaming",
    "tenant_id": "tenant-a",
    "title": "流式响应生命周期",
    "content": "流式响应先创建并进入进行中状态，再持续发送文本 delta，最后发送文本完成、输出项完成和整个响应完成事件。客户端必须处理超时、取消和半成品输出。",
    "source_uri": "kb://tenant-a/streaming",
    "version": 1,
    "updated_at": "2026-07-20T00:00:00Z",
    "expires_at": null,
    "deleted": false,
    "authority": 0.9,
    "allowed_users": ["user-1", "user-2"]
  },
  {
    "id": "doc-rate-limit",
    "tenant_id": "tenant-a",
    "title": "速率限制",
    "content": "RPM 是每分钟请求数，RPD 是每天请求数，TPM 是每分钟 Token 数，TPD 是每天 Token 数。客户端应读取响应头并使用带抖动的指数退避。",
    "source_uri": "kb://tenant-a/rate-limit",
    "version": 1,
    "updated_at": "2026-07-21T00:00:00Z",
    "expires_at": null,
    "deleted": false,
    "authority": 0.95,
    "allowed_users": ["user-1", "user-2"]
  },
  {
    "id": "doc-qdrant",
    "tenant_id": "tenant-a",
    "title": "本地向量存储",
    "content": "本实验的 Mem0 开源模式使用进程内 Qdrant 持久化向量，不启动网络端口。Embedding 使用确定性的本地字符哈希向量，避免云 Key 和模型下载。",
    "source_uri": "kb://tenant-a/qdrant",
    "version": 1,
    "updated_at": "2026-08-11T00:00:00Z",
    "expires_at": null,
    "deleted": false,
    "authority": 1.0,
    "allowed_users": ["user-1", "user-2"]
  },
  {
